OL,4,BBotman banned from driving for using   
OL,5,Bphone at wheel                         
OL,6,GPremier League footballer Sven Botman  
OL,7,Ghas been banned from driving after     
OL,8,Gbeing caught using his mobile phone at 
OL,9,Gthe wheel.                             
OL,11,FThe Newcastle United centre-back       
OL,12,Fpleaded guilty to using a handheld     
OL,13,Fmobile phone while using a motor       
OL,14,Fvehicle on a road at Newcastle         
OL,15,FMagistrates' Court on Wednesday.       
OL,17,FThe 26-year-old was given six penalty  
OL,18,Fpoints and disqualified from driving   
OL,19,Ffor six months, as these were added to 
OL,20,Fpoints he had already accrued.         
